    title: "微軟（Microsoft）榮獲 Forrester 認可：在工作人員身份安全平台領域具備領導地位",
    summary: "本文宣布微軟（Microsoft）在 Forrester Wave™：工作人員身份安全平台（Workforce Identity Security Platforms）Q2 2026 報告中，被認可為領導者（Leader）。這項認可強調了微軟 Entra 產品組合在當前產品和策略兩大類別中均獲得最高評分。報告指出，身份（Identity）已成為現代網路安全的核心，其管理已從單純的存取檢查點，轉變為管理整體風險的主要方式。隨著 AI 應用擴展，身份複雜度增加，組織必須管理包括人類使用者、AI 代理（AI agents）在內的多種非人身份。為應對這種結構性轉變，安全系統需要從分散的工具集合，轉向整合了訊號、存取策略和回應流程的「存取結構」（Access Fabric）。微軟 Entra 透過整合身份、存取和回應（Identity, Access, and Response），幫助企業實現連續的風險評估和控制，並能將一致的存取策略應用於雲端、本地端和第三方應用程式的任何身份，從而提升整體安全態勢。",
    tags: ["Microsoft Entra", "Forrester Wave", "身份安全", "零信任架構", "AI 代理", "工作人員身份"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Recognized by Forrester: Leader in Workforce Identity Security Platforms",
    summary_en: "This article announces that Microsoft was recognized as a Leader in the Forrester Wave™: Workforce Identity Security Platforms Q2 2026 report. This recognition highlights that the Microsoft Entra product suite achieved top scores in both current product offerings and strategy. The report points out that Identity has become the core of modern cybersecurity, and its management has evolved from a simple access checkpoint to the primary method for managing overall risk. As AI applications expand, identity complexity increases, requiring organizations to manage multiple non-human identities, including human users and AI agents. To address this structural shift, security systems must move from a collection of disparate tools to an 'Access Fabric' that integrates signals, access policies, and response workflows. Microsoft Entra helps enterprises achieve continuous risk assessment and control by integrating Identity, Access, and Response, allowing consistent access policies to be applied to any identity across cloud, on-premises, and third-party applications, thereby enhancing the overall security posture.",
