    title: "歐盟網路韌性法案（CRA）標準化研討會：聚焦中小企業合規指引與工具",
    summary: "本次研討會旨在協助中小企業（SMEs）理解並實務應對歐盟網路韌性法案（CRA）的強制性網路安全要求。由於CRA的實施，歐洲標準化組織（ESOs）如ETSI和CEN-CENELEC正在積極開發相關的調和標準。研討會匯集了多個歐盟資助專案，包括CYBERSTAND.eu、OCCTET、CURIUM、CRACoWI和CONFIRMATE等，這些專案提供了從標準開發、開源軟體（FOSS）合規自動化、安全測試到認證文件化的實用工具和指引。參與者可以了解CRA的具體要求、哪些標準是關鍵，並掌握將法規要求轉化為產品開發和符合性流程的實務方法。這對於希望了解CRA影響、追蹤標準化進度，並尋求合規工具和資金支持的企業極為重要。",
    tags: ["Cyber Resilience Act", "CRA", "中小企業", "標準化", "ETSI", "CEN-CENELEC"],
    title_en: "EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA) Standardization Workshop: Focusing on SME Compliance Guidance and Tools",
    summary_en: "This workshop aims to help Small and Medium-sized Enterprises (SMEs) understand and practically address the mandatory cybersecurity requirements of the EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA). Due to the implementation of CRA, European Standardization Organizations (ESOs) such as ETSI and CEN-CENELEC are actively developing related harmonized standards. The workshop gathered multiple EU-funded projects, including CYBERSTAND.eu, OCCTET, CURIUM, CRACoWI, and CONFIRMATE. These projects offer practical tools and guidance ranging from standard development, open-source software (FOSS) compliance automation, and security testing to certification documentation. Participants can learn about the specific requirements of CRA, identify key standards, and master practical methods for translating regulatory requirements into product development and conformity processes. This is crucial for companies looking to understand the impact of CRA, track standardization progress, and seek compliance tools and funding support.",
